Everyone, keep calm.

17:21.000 --> 17:22.000
Keep calm.

17:22.000 --> 17:23.000
Just try to get rid of them.

17:23.000 --> 17:24.000
Yes.

17:24.000 --> 17:25.000
Come on.

17:25.000 --> 17:26.000
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

17:26.000 --> 17:27.000
Come on.

17:27.000 --> 17:28.000
Come on.

17:28.000 --> 17:29.000
Come on.

17:29.000 --> 17:30.000
Come on.

17:30.000 --> 17:31.000
Come on.

17:31.000 --> 17:32.000
Come on.

17:32.000 --> 17:33.000
Come on.

17:33.000 --> 17:34.000
Come on.

17:34.000 --> 17:35.000
Come on.

17:35.000 --> 17:36.000
Come on.

17:36.000 --> 17:37.000
Come on.

17:37.000 --> 17:38.000
Come on.

17:38.000 --> 17:39.000
Come on.

17:39.000 --> 17:42.000
Come on.

17:42.000 --> 17:44.000
We got to get him in the wagon.

17:44.000 --> 17:46.000
You get him in the wagon.

17:46.000 --> 17:47.000
Come on.

17:53.000 --> 17:55.000
Remember, everybody, keep calm.

17:55.000 --> 17:58.000
Daphne, I don't know if I can stand the suspense.

17:58.000 --> 18:01.000
We've got to do something to make them think we're not concerned.

18:01.000 --> 18:02.000
Yeah.

18:03.000 --> 18:05.000
