18:21.340 --> 18:22.220
Um, what are you folks celebrating?

18:22.220 --> 18:23.040
Our wedding anniversary.

18:23.040 --> 18:23.880
I'm coming out, Marty.

18:23.880 --> 18:24.720
Happy birthday.

18:24.720 --> 18:27.580
You sure got a lot to celebrate.

18:27.580 --> 18:29.520
What would you count for some bubbly?

18:29.520 --> 18:31.080
Um, no thanks.

18:31.080 --> 18:34.680
Do you know there are bear tracks around your camp?

18:34.680 --> 18:36.660
